==Latin==

===Etymology===
{{etymon|la|id=big|inh|itc-pro>*grandis>big}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*grandis}}, of unclear origin.

Traditionally derived from {{der|la|ine-pro|*gʰer-|t=to rub, to grind}}, and connected to {{cog|gem-pro|*grautaz|t=big in size, coarse, coarse grained}} (whence {{cog|en|great}}). A different etymology, favored by Pokorny, derives the word from {{der|la|ine-pro|*gʷʰrendʰ-|t=to swell}}, and connects the word to {{cog|grc|βρένθος|t=arrogance}} and {{cog|sla-pro|*grǫ̑dь|t=breast}}.

However, De Vaan rejects the latter (and doesn't mention the former) due to phonetic difficulties and the wide semantic gap between "breast-pride" and "breast-large".

